        [" ", "Sweetest love, I do not go"],
        [" ", "\tFor weariness of thee,"],
        [" ", "Nor in hope the world can show"],
        [" ", "\tA fitter love for me;"],
        ["5", "\t\tBut since that I"],
        [" ", "Must die at last, 'tis best"],
        [" ", "To use myself in jest,"],
        [" ", "\tThus by feigned deaths to die.\n\n"],
        [" ", "`text(Yesternight)` the sun went hence,"],
        ["10", "\tAnd yet is here `text(today)`;"],
        [" ", "He hath no desire nor sense,"],
        [" ", "\tNor `text(half)` so short a way:"],
        [" ", "\t\tThen fear not me,"],
        [" ", "But believe that I shall make"],
        ["15", "Speedier journeys, since I take"],
        [" ", "\tMore wings and spurs than he.\n\n"],
        [" ", "O how feeble is man's power,"],
        [" ", "\tThat if good fortune fall,"],
        [" ", "Cannot add another `text(hour)`,"],
        ["20", "\tNor a lost `text(hour)` recall!"],
        [" ", "\t\tBut come bad chance,"],
        [" ", "And we join to it our strength,"],
        [" ", "And we teach it art and length,"],
        [" ", "\tItself o'er us to advance.\n\n"],
        ["25", "When thou sigh'st, thou sigh'st not wind,"],
        [" ", "\tBut sigh'st my soul away;"],
        [" ", "When thou weep'st, unkindly kind,"],
        [" ", "\tMy life's blood doth decay."],
        [" ", "\t\tIt cannot be"],
        ["30", "That thou lov'st me, as thou say'st,"],
        [" ", "If in thine my life thou waste;"],
        [" ", "\tThou art the best of me.\n\n"],
        [" ", "Let not thy divining heart"],
        [" ", "\tForethink me any ill;"],
        ["35", "Destiny may take thy part,"],
        [" ", "\tAnd may thy fears fulfill;"],
        [" ", "\t\tBut think that we"],
        [" ", "Are but turned aside to sleep;"],
        [" ", "They who `text(one)` another keep"],
        ["40", "\tAlive, ne'er parted be.\n\n"],
        [" ", "(`1633`)"]
    ],
